## LaTeX Resume Considerations

### Advantages
- Clean, professional appearance
- Excellent PDF text layer (machine-readable)
- Consistent formatting
- Version control friendly

### ATS Compatibility
**Awesome-CV Template Specifically:**
- ✅ Single column layout
- ✅ Clear section headers
- ✅ Standard fonts (Roboto)
- ✅ No graphics in content sections
- ✅ Properly tagged PDF output
- ⚠️ FontAwesome icons: Generally okay, but some older ATS may not parse

**Best Practices:**
- Compile to PDF with text layer (pdflatex or xelatex)
- Test by copying text from PDF - should preserve structure
- Avoid custom commands that break text extraction
- Keep icon use minimal and never as substitutes for text

