## 2025 Emerging Trends

### Context-Aware AI
- Systems now parse GitHub profiles, LinkedIn, portfolios alongside resume
- Consistency across platforms matters more than ever
- Public code repositories can validate claimed skills

### Explainable AI
- Some platforms now show why candidates were scored certain ways
- Transparency helps identify optimization opportunities
- Candidates may see "missing: 3 required skills" type feedback

### Skills-Based Over Credentials
- Growing emphasis on demonstrable skills vs. degrees/pedigree
- Project portfolios and contributions weighted more heavily
- Bootcamp/self-taught paths less penalized if skills proven

### Bias Mitigation Tools
- Some companies using blind screening (removing names, schools)
- Focus on objective metrics over subjective assessments
- Regular AI model audits for fairness

