## Practical Application Checklist

When optimizing a resume:

- [ ] Extract all keywords from target job description
- [ ] Map resume content to required vs preferred qualifications
- [ ] Quantify every bullet point possible (add metrics)
- [ ] Replace passive/vague language with action verbs
- [ ] Mirror job posting terminology exactly for critical skills
- [ ] Test PDF text extraction
- [ ] Remove graphics, tables, complex formatting
- [ ] Ensure standard section headers
- [ ] Verify consistent date formatting
- [ ] Include both acronyms and full terms for key technologies
- [ ] Front-load impact statements (results before methods)
- [ ] Proofread for typos and grammar errors
- [ ] Have both technical and non-technical people review
- [ ] Run through ATS simulator if available
- [ ] Confirm file is saved as parseable PDF or .docx

